<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Posts on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/</link><description>Recent content in Posts on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/post/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>12星座對應脈輪指南：找到你最需要平衡的能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;占星與脈輪，是兩套不同的系統——但它們&lt;strong&gt;互相對應&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>巨蟹座性格全解析：水象開創宮的情感堡壘與母性能量</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E5%A0%A1%E5%A3%98%E8%88%87%E6%AF%8D%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E5%A0%A1%E5%A3%98%E8%88%87%E6%AF%8D%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;巨蟹座的符號是一隻&lt;strong&gt;螃蟹&lt;/strong&gt;——一個有堅硬外殼但內在柔軟的生物。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;這個符號是了解巨蟹座的鑰匙。&lt;strong&gt;他們的硬，是用來保護裡面的柔軟&lt;/strong&gt;。當你看見一個巨蟹座表面冷淡、不易親近——那不是他們真實的樣子，那是他們的殼。真正的巨蟹是十二星座中&lt;strong&gt;內心最柔軟、最有同理心、最重感情&lt;/strong&gt;的——但他們不會輕易讓你看見裡面，除非你證明你不會傷害他們。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>牡羊座性格全解析：火象開創宮的能量、優勢與成長課題</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%84%AA%E5%8B%A2%E8%88%87%E6%88%90%E9%95%B7%E8%AA%B2%E9%A1%8C/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%84%AA%E5%8B%A2%E8%88%87%E6%88%90%E9%95%B7%E8%AA%B2%E9%A1%8C/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;牡羊座是&lt;strong&gt;黃道十二宮的第一個星座&lt;/strong&gt;——這個位置不是隨便排的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>射手座性格全解析：火象變動宮的真理探索與自由靈魂</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E9%9D%88%E9%AD%82/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E9%9D%88%E9%AD%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;射手座的符號是&lt;strong&gt;半人馬射出的箭&lt;/strong&gt;——一個一半是人、一半是馬的存在，正在把箭瞄向遠方。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天蠍座性格全解析：水象固定宮的深度轉化與重生力量</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%89%E5%8C%96%E8%88%87%E9%87%8D%E7%94%9F%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%89%E5%8C%96%E8%88%87%E9%87%8D%E7%94%9F%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果說獅子座是太陽——光芒外放，所有人都能看見；那天蠍座就是&lt;strong&gt;深海&lt;/strong&gt;——表面平靜，深處卻有完全另一個世界。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>接地、能量淨化、冥想：脈輪日常療癒三大實作技巧</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果說脈輪療癒有一套&lt;strong&gt;最低限度的日常保養 SOP&lt;/strong&gt;，那就是這三件事：&lt;strong&gt;接地（Grounding）、能量淨化（Energy Cleansing）、冥想（Meditation）&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>獅子座性格全解析：火象固定宮的舞台魅力與領袖之心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%88%9E%E5%8F%B0%E9%AD%85%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E9%A0%98%E8%A2%96%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%88%9E%E5%8F%B0%E9%AD%85%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E9%A0%98%E8%A2%96%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;獅子座是十二星座裡，&lt;strong&gt;唯一被太陽守護的星座&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>脈輪失衡的常見徵兆：身心警訊怎麼讀懂能量訊息</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</link><pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;身體比你聰明。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>雙子座性格全解析：風象變動宮的好奇雙面與心智宇宙</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%87%E9%9B%99%E9%9D%A2%E8%88%87%E5%BF%83%E6%99%BA%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99/</link><pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%87%E9%9B%99%E9%9D%A2%E8%88%87%E5%BF%83%E6%99%BA%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;雙子座的符號是&lt;strong&gt;雙生子&lt;/strong&gt;——兩個一模一樣卻面向不同方向的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>臍輪完整指南：橘色情感之輪喚醒創造力與感官生命力</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%87%8D%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%A9%98%E8%89%B2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%96%9A%E9%86%92%E5%89%B5%E9%80%A0%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%8A%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%87%8D%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%A9%98%E8%89%B2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%96%9A%E9%86%92%E5%89%B5%E9%80%A0%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%8A%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果說海底輪管「&lt;strong&gt;我是不是安全的&lt;/strong&gt;」，那臍輪管的就是下一個層次的問題：「&lt;strong&gt;我有沒有允許自己感受？我有沒有讓自己活著？&lt;/strong&gt;」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>太陽星座vs月亮星座vs上升星座：誰才是真正的你</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7vs%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%AE%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7vs%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%87%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%AA%B0%E6%89%8D%E6%98%AF%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%A0/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7vs%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%AE%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7vs%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%87%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%AA%B0%E6%89%8D%E6%98%AF%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%A0/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;每次有人問你「&lt;strong&gt;你什麼星座？&lt;/strong&gt;」——你的回答是「&lt;strong&gt;處女座&lt;/strong&gt;」「&lt;strong&gt;雙魚座&lt;/strong&gt;」「&lt;strong&gt;牡羊座&lt;/strong&gt;」？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>太陽神經叢完整指南：黃色力量之輪建立自我價值與行動力</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%A5%9E%E7%B6%93%E5%8F%A2%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%BB%83%E8%89%B2%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E5%83%B9%E5%80%BC%E8%88%87%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95%E5%8A%9B/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%A5%9E%E7%B6%93%E5%8F%A2%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%BB%83%E8%89%B2%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E5%83%B9%E5%80%BC%E8%88%87%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95%E5%8A%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「&lt;strong&gt;我不夠好。&lt;/strong&gt;」「&lt;strong&gt;我做不到。&lt;/strong&gt;」「&lt;strong&gt;算了，照他們說的吧。&lt;/strong&gt;」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>金牛座性格全解析：土象固定宮的踏實感官與生命節奏</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%B8%8F%E5%AF%A6%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E8%88%87%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%AF%80%E5%A5%8F/</link><pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%B8%8F%E5%AF%A6%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E8%88%87%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%AF%80%E5%A5%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果讓十二星座參加一場「&lt;strong&gt;穩&lt;/strong&gt;」的比賽，金牛座大概會贏所有人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>眉心輪完整指南：靛色第三眼開啟直覺洞察與內在智慧</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「&lt;strong&gt;第三眼&lt;/strong&gt;」是靈性圈最常被討論、也最容易被誤解的詞。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>雙魚座性格全解析：水象變動宮的夢境靈性與宇宙之愛</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%A2%83%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%A2%83%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;雙魚座是黃道十二宮的最後一個星座——這個位置不是隨便排的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪守護水晶速查表：每個脈輪該配什麼石頭最有感</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶療癒這幾年很紅——但很多人買了一堆水晶，卻不知道&lt;strong&gt;哪個對應哪個脈輪&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;該怎麼搭配&lt;/strong&gt;。買到對的水晶，能感覺能量明顯改變；買到不對的或亂配，效果就只是「漂亮」。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>心輪完整指南：綠色愛之輪打開人際連結與自我慈悲</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果問你：「&lt;strong&gt;你愛自己嗎？&lt;/strong&gt;」——你的第一反應會是什麼？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水瓶座性格全解析：風象固定宮的創新前衛與人道精神</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水瓶座的中文名字常讓人誤會——以為「&lt;strong&gt;水瓶&lt;/strong&gt;」是水象星座。其實不是，水瓶座是&lt;strong&gt;風象星座&lt;/strong&gt;，符號的水瓶倒出的也不是水，是**「知識之水」**。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>處女座性格全解析：土象變動宮的分析力與服務之愛</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;處女座是十二星座裡，&lt;strong&gt;最容易被誤解的一個&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天秤座性格全解析：風象開創宮的平衡美學與夥伴關係</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%B8%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A5%E4%BC%B4%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%B8%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A5%E4%BC%B4%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;天秤座是十二星座裡唯一&lt;strong&gt;以「物品」為符號&lt;/strong&gt;的星座——不是動物、不是人，而是一個&lt;strong&gt;天秤&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>頂輪完整指南：紫色冠之輪連結宇宙意識與靈性圓滿</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;七大脈輪走到最後，到了頭頂——這是**頂輪（Sahasrara, Crown Chakra）**所在的位置，也是整套能量地圖的盡頭。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪完整入門：從海底輪到頂輪的能量地圖一次看懂</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「脈輪」這個詞，這幾年從瑜伽課堂、靈氣療癒到 IG 命理帳號到處都看得到。可是真的問起來：&lt;strong&gt;七個脈輪是哪七個？順序怎麼排？為什麼有對應顏色和水晶？要從哪一個開始練？&lt;/strong&gt;——能完整答得出來的人其實不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>摩羯座性格全解析：土象開創宮的紀律野心與時間哲學</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%80%E5%BE%8B%E9%87%8E%E5%BF%83%E8%88%87%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%80%E5%BE%8B%E9%87%8E%E5%BF%83%E8%88%87%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;要懂摩羯座，得先懂一件事：&lt;strong&gt;他們是十二星座裡，唯一把「時間」當朋友的人。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;別人怕老、怕慢、怕等不到，摩羯座剛好相反——他們知道好東西要熬，目標要分十年達成，山要一步一步爬。如果你身邊有摩羯，你可能注意過：他們很少說大話，但說過的話幾乎都做到了；他們不會在第一年就閃閃發光，可是十年後回頭看，他們是同齡人裡爬最高的那一個。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>海底輪完整指南：紅色根之輪如何打造安全感與接地能量</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果你曾經在凌晨三點醒來，胸口悶悶地，腦袋一片亂，又說不出到底在擔心什麼——那種「&lt;strong&gt;好像有什麼地方不安全&lt;/strong&gt;」的感覺，往往不是真的有事，而是你的**海底輪（Muladhara, Root Chakra）**正在跟你說話。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>喉輪完整指南：藍色表達之輪說出真實與創意之聲</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;你有沒有過這種經驗？心裡明明有滿滿的話想說，可是話到嘴邊就吞回去；或是會議上明明知道答案，卻在被點到那一刻喉嚨突然發乾、聲音變小、整個人縮了起來？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天秤座守護水晶完整指南：葡萄石與青金石的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E9%9D%92%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E9%9D%92%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;天秤座的人生，是一場永恆的秤量——這邊多一點好呢，還是那邊多一點？這個選擇更對呢，還是那個？當所有人都在往前衝的時候，天秤座站在十字路口，認真地想要找到那個最公平、最美好、最不傷害任何人的答案。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>獅子座守護水晶完整指南：金髮晶與太陽石的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果十二星座是一座劇場，獅子座毫無疑問站在舞台的正中央——聚光燈打下來的那個位置，就是為他們準備的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黑碧璽功效完整解析：最強大地守護石</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E7%9F%B3/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E7%9F%B3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果水晶世界裡有一位沉默的守門人，那一定是黑碧璽。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;它不像&lt;a href="https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/"&gt;紫水晶&lt;/a&gt;那樣散發著靈性的紫光，也不像粉水晶那樣帶著甜蜜的粉紅——黑碧璽是徹底的黑，深沉、不透光、毫不張揚。但正是這份沉穩的黑，讓它成為水晶療癒領域中最被信賴的防護石。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>風象星座能量解析：雙子天秤水瓶的風之性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;風有很多種吹拂的方式——有的是春天的穿堂風，在每扇窗之間穿梭，帶來各個房間的消息；有的是傍晚的微風，溫柔地拂過水面，讓一切歸於和諧的漣漪；有的是高空的氣流，看不見摸不著，卻悄悄改變了整片天空的走向。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12星座守護水晶完整對照表：找到你的命定之石</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%B0%8D%E7%85%A7%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E7%9F%B3/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%B0%8D%E7%85%A7%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E7%9F%B3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;每個星座都有屬於自己的能量頻率，而在礦物的世界裡，也有一顆石頭正靜靜等著與你共振。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水象星座能量解析：巨蟹天蠍雙魚的深海性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%B7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%B7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水有很多種存在的方式——有的是溫暖的泉眼，從地底源源不絕地湧出，滋養著身邊的每一寸土地；有的是深不見底的海溝，表面看似平靜，底下卻藏著驚人的壓力與暗流；有的是無邊際的薄霧，瀰漫在空氣中，觸碰不到卻無處不在。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>火象星座能量解析：牡羊獅子射手的火焰性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;火焰有很多種燃燒的方式——有的像剛擦亮的火柴，瞬間點燃整片黑暗；有的像壁爐裡的炭火，持續散發溫暖的光芒；有的像營火的火星，隨風飄散到意想不到的遠方。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>牡羊座守護水晶完整指南：海藍寶與紅碧玉的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7%E8%97%8D%E5%AF%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B4%85%E7%A2%A7%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7%E8%97%8D%E5%AF%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B4%85%E7%A2%A7%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;牡羊座的能量像一把剛點燃的火焰——燃燒得又快又烈，照亮了整個房間，卻也偶爾不小心燙到身邊的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>處女座守護水晶完整指南：粉水晶與藍紋瑪瑙的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B2%89%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E8%97%8D%E7%B4%8B%E7%91%AA%E7%91%99%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B2%89%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E8%97%8D%E7%B4%8B%E7%91%AA%E7%91%99%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;處女座的內心住著一把精密的量尺，不斷測量著世界與自己之間的距離——哪裡還不夠好，哪裡還可以更好。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>土象星座能量解析：金牛處女摩羯的大地性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大地有很多種存在的方式——有的是春天的沃土，溫暖而肥沃，萬物都想在這裡扎根；有的是精心打理的花園，每一寸都被仔細安排，沒有一片葉子是多餘的；有的是高聳入雲的山岩，歷經風霜卻紋風不動，頂端的風景只屬於願意攀登的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶 x 眉心輪 &amp; 頂輪：一顆石頭，同時打開兩個靈性能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大多數水晶只對應一個脈輪。紫水晶不一樣——它同時連結眉心輪和頂輪，也就是七脈輪體系裡最頂端的兩個能量中心。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶功效完整解析：靈性修行入門首選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在水晶店走了一圈，最後手裡還是捧著一顆紫水晶——你不孤單，幾乎每個人的起點都在這裡。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶怎麼用？冥想、助眠、空間淨化實戰完整指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;買了紫水晶，然後呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶星座配對：雙魚、水瓶、射手為什麼特別有緣？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同樣一顆紫水晶，有人戴了感覺渾身舒暢，有人帶了幾個月幾乎沒感覺。這不全然是「信不信的問題」——星座跟水晶的共振確實有差。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶淨化方法完整指南：月光浴、煙燻、聲音療癒怎麼選？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶需要淨化——這件事很多人知道，但真正做到的不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>揭開誕生石的神奇面紗：揭開每顆寶石背後隱藏的意義和個性</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E8%AA%95%E7%94%9F%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E9%9D%A2%E7%B4%97%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E6%AF%8F%E9%A1%86%E5%AF%B6%E7%9F%B3%E8%83%8C%E5%BE%8C%E9%9A%B1%E8%97%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E7%BE%A9%E5%92%8C%E5%80%8B%E6%80%A7/</link><pubDate>Wed, 14 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E8%AA%95%E7%94%9F%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E9%9D%A2%E7%B4%97%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E6%AF%8F%E9%A1%86%E5%AF%B6%E7%9F%B3%E8%83%8C%E5%BE%8C%E9%9A%B1%E8%97%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E7%BE%A9%E5%92%8C%E5%80%8B%E6%80%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在星座學中，每個人的生日都與特定的寶石相關聯。這些寶石被稱為「誕生石」，據說具有特殊的意義和能量。讓我們釋放宇宙能量，發揮誕生石在你生活中的個人意義&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>渣女星座大解析：最毒舌、狡猾心機的星座</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%9012%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%80%E5%85%B7%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E7%8B%A1%E7%8C%BE%E5%BF%83%E6%A9%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E5%80%91/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%9012%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%80%E5%85%B7%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E7%8B%A1%E7%8C%BE%E5%BF%83%E6%A9%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E5%80%91/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;我揭示了星座界最具有心機的渣女星座的特質和套路。以及最擅長玩弄感情的 TOP3 星座渣女，以及她們常見的套路。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>最多渣男渣女的5個星座</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E6%B8%A3%E7%94%B7%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%845%E5%80%8B%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 30 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E6%B8%A3%E7%94%B7%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%845%E5%80%8B%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;今天我們要聊一個有趣的主題——&amp;ldquo;最濫情的 5 個星座&amp;rdquo;。&#10;我們都知道，星座和個性之間有著某種聯繫&#10;現在就讓我們來看看哪些星座在愛情中格外濫情吧！&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>6月12星座運勢分析</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/6%E6%9C%8812%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/6%E6%9C%8812%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;2023年6月&#10;12星座各自的6月運勢詳細分析&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>考運爆表的TOP5星座</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%80%83%E9%81%8B%E7%88%86%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84top5%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%80%83%E9%81%8B%E7%88%86%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84top5%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想要有好的成績，平常的耕耘十分重要，但是關鍵時刻也是需要有好運氣神助攻，那樣是不是就更好了呢?&#10;(參考太陽與上升星座)&#10;看看哪些幸運的小夥伴能得到好運神助攻呢&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>命運指南：如何運用命理學提升您的事業發展</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%91%BD%E9%81%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%81%8B%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%91%BD%E9%81%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%81%8B%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;命運，它似乎像是一條神秘的脈絡，潛移默化地影響著我們的生活。然而，您知道嗎？命理學可以幫助我們更好地理解命運的運行規律，並提供指導和策略，以提升事業發展的機會。讓我們一起來探討命理學在事業成功中的指導作用，並提供一些實用的建議和策略。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>了解您的星座運勢：揭示您的財富機會</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E6%8F%AD%E7%A4%BA%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%B2%A1%E5%AF%8C%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E6%8F%AD%E7%A4%BA%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%B2%A1%E5%AF%8C%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;探索不同星座的命理特點，為您揭示財富增長的機會與建議&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>星座與愛情：找尋與您星座最相配的伴侶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85%E6%89%BE%E5%B0%8B%E8%88%87%E6%82%A8%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E6%9C%80%E7%9B%B8%E9%85%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%B4%E4%BE%B6/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85%E6%89%BE%E5%B0%8B%E8%88%87%E6%82%A8%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E6%9C%80%E7%9B%B8%E9%85%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%B4%E4%BE%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;深入研究不同星座之間的愛情相容性，為您尋找真愛提供指南&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>提升運勢能量：命理學中的秘訣與儀式</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E8%A8%A3%E8%88%87%E5%84%80%E5%BC%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E8%A8%A3%E8%88%87%E5%84%80%E5%BC%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;分享命理學中提升運勢能量的秘訣和儀式，助您獲得更好的運勢&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>